dl.dd:
the transformation that maps the string a = (a_s, ... , a_1)
in V_s into the string MSB_i(a) = (a_s, ... , a_{s-i+1}) in
V_i (most significant bits);

the transformation that maps the string a = (a_s, ... , a_1)
in V_s into the string LSB_i(a) = (a_i, ... , a_1) in V_i
(least significant bits);
